                                "sense_id": "6c5b67cc-bd94-3fa7-90d5-2838d77a8c42",
                                "text": "All (pre-nominal) participial modifiers in Hindi have a statal meaning whether or not they involve a statal verb (something like “in the state of sleeping / having slept / running / eating / having been washed”, etc.)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
